{"id":"476d67d753efdb3f","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbdeg.md","title":"Pseudo-Boolean degree","display":"df-pbdeg — Pseudo-Boolean degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbdeg","aliases":["27-df-pbdeg"],"display":"df-pbdeg — Pseudo-Boolean degree","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbcoeff]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.2","source_statement":"Definition 13.1; explicit zero-function convention","source_printed_pages":"571","source_pdf_pages":"595","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbdeg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbdeg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbdeg — Pseudo-Boolean degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Definition 13.1; explicit zero-function convention"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"571"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"595"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_f:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(c_f:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\deg:\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\},\\qquad\\deg(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|S|\\mid S\\subseteq N\\land c_f(S)\\neq0\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\deg:\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\},\\qquad\\deg(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|S|\\mid S\\subseteq N\\land c_f(S)\\neq0\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Definition 13.1 的实多线性次数。本笔记显式约定零函数次数为 0，以使函数在全部 PseudoBool_n 上有定义；原书的 max 表达式在全零系数时未另作说明。它不同于 DNF 项长度，也不同于 GF(2) 多项式次数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbcoeff]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$c_f:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"c_f:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg:\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\},\\qquad\\deg(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|S|\\mid S\\subseteq N\\land c_f(S)\\neq0\\}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1351,"backlinks":[{"id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$ 及其次数 $\\deg$（see [[27-df-pbdeg]]）。"},{"id":"057daf715bc20324","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n,\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n,\\deg$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]], [[27-df-quadpb]], [[27-df-pbdeg]]）。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-281","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbdeg|df-pbdeg — Pseudo-Boolean degree]]"}],"outgoing":["7937ecc11ac59760"]}